WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:02.869
Before we get to the news,

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.637
Donald Trump gave
a press conference

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:07.106
right before we started taping,

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:10.309
which means it's time
for "Breaking Crazy."

00:00:10.309 --> 00:00:13.379
♪♪

00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:15.548
President Trump this afternoon
gave a press conference

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:19.285
that can only be described
as clinically insane.

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:20.920
You know that list
of side effects

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.688
at the end
of a pharmaceutical ad?

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:25.058
He apparently has all of them.

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:26.526
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:29.596
He said among other things
that there were very fine people

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:32.265
on both sides of the events
of Charlottesville.

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:34.767
He asked if people on the left
have any guilt

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:37.036
that the white supremacists
became violent,

00:00:37.036 --> 00:00:38.404
and then he said this...

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:41.941 line:0%
-Many of those people were
there to protest the taking down

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:46.212 line:0%
of the statue of Robert E. Lee,
so this week it's Robert E. Lee.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:49.148 line:0%
I notice that
Stonewall Jackson's coming down.

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:51.184 line:0%
I wonder, is it
George Washington next week?

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:53.686 line:0%
And is it Thomas Jefferson
the week after?

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.721 line:0%
You know, you really do have
to ask yourself,

00:00:55.721 --> 00:00:57.089 line:0%
where does it stop?

00:00:57.089 --> 00:01:00.226
-Where does it stop?
Buddy, we've been asking

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.995
ourselves that question
since January.

00:01:02.995 --> 00:01:10.169
[ Laughter,
cheers and applause ]

00:01:10.169 --> 00:01:12.872
Normally when someone is talking
that level of crazy,

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:15.942
Batman crashes through
the ceiling and punches him.

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:17.110
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:19.378
Trump is like a bad waitress
in a crappy diner

00:01:19.378 --> 00:01:22.782
who's trying to get fired
so she can go to a concert.

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:23.916
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.916 --> 00:01:25.284
Here's a picture of
General John Kelly,

00:01:25.284 --> 00:01:27.854
his new Chief of Staff,
during this press conference.

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:29.489
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:32.491
Look at that guy. Trump is
so fully out of his mind,

00:01:32.491 --> 00:01:34.627
he broke a general.

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:36.162
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:38.197
That guy's been in wars.

00:01:38.197 --> 00:01:39.565
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.565 --> 00:01:42.701
Congress, isn't this enough?
Cut bait on the President.

00:01:42.701 --> 00:01:45.638
It's time to let this
crazy bitch go to the concert.

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:48.741
This has been "Breaking Crazy."

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:50.910
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.177
♪♪

00:01:52.177 --> 00:01:53.113
[ Applause continues ]

